flowchart TD
  validate{Check the inputs}:::check
  validate -->|refused| invalid(Refused: an input is missing, malformed or not used):::transform
  validate -->|ok| attach[Attach the change log]:::query
  attach --> decide{Read the source and what it owns, and decide}:::check
  decide -->|refused| refused(Refused: a stale epoch or a different confirmation):::transform
  decide -->|already| already(Already deleted, or being deleted for a dry run):::transform
  decide -->|would| preview[Dry run: record the preview]:::load
  decide -->|act| act[Spend the preview and mark the source deleting, then drop what it created]:::load
  act --> outcome{Result}:::check
  outcome -->|done| done(Deleted: capture stopped; mirrors and the log kept):::transform
  outcome -->|already| already
  outcome -->|waiting| waiting(Waiting: a reader is still attached, or the lease is busy; run again):::transform
  outcome -->|refused| moved(Refused: no matching preview, or the source changed):::transform
  whois[Look up who started this run]:::query
  audit[Copy the result to the operations database]:::load
  audit --> snapshot[Refresh the operations snapshot, once]:::load
